            0.128
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. There were 2 new admissions to Sudhakar’s class just a couple of days after the class average height was found to be 150.2 cm."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.204,
            0.131,
            0.754,
            0.152
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Which of the following statements are correct? Why?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.234,
            0.155,
            0.847,
            0.194
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) The average height of the class will increase as there are 2 new values."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.234,
            0.198,
            0.788,
            0.219
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) The average height of the class will remain the same."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.234,
            0.222,
            0.847,
            0.26
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) The heights of the new students have to be measured to find out the new average height."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.234,
            0.264,
            0.846,
            0.304
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) The heights of everyone in the class has to be measured again to calculate the new average height."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.198,
            0.312,
            0.847,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) The heights of the two new joinees are 149 cm and 152 cm. Which of the following statements about the class’ average height are correct? Why?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.234,
            0.373,
            0.61,
            0.394
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) The average will remain the same."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.234,
            0.397,
            0.53,
            0.417
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) The average will increase."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.234,
            0.421,
            0.533,
            0.441
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) The average will decrease."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.234,
            0.445,
            0.846,
            0.485
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) The information is not sufficient to make a claim about the average."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.492,
            0.845,
            0.532
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) Which of the following statements about the new class average height are correct? Why?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.234,
            0.535,
            0.607,
            0.556
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) The median will remain the same."
